  "女": "Female",
  "<html><head/><body><p>搜寻的最佳姿势?</p><p>【包含搜寻】</p><p>搜寻全彩[空格][+]人妻,仅显示全彩且是人妻的本本</p><p>范例:全彩 +人妻<br/></p><p>【排除搜寻】</p><p>搜寻全彩[空格][]人妻,显示全彩并排除人妻的本本</p><p>范例:全彩 -人妻<br/></p><p>【我都要搜寻】</p><p>搜寻全彩[空格]人妻,会显示所有包含全彩及人妻的本本</p><p>范例:全彩 人妻</p></body></html>": "<html><head/><body><p>Best way to search?</p><p>[Include Search]</p><p>Search for full color [space] [+] married woman; only show comics that match both terms.</p><p>Example: full color +married woman<br/></p><p>[Exclude Search]</p><p>Search for full color [space] [-] married woman; show full color comics while excluding married woman.</p><p>Example: full color -married woman<br/></p><p>[Match All Terms]</p><p>Search for full color [space] married woman; show comics containing both terms.</p><p>Example: full color married woman</p></body></html>",
  "<html><head/><body><p>搜寻的最佳姿势?</p><p>【精确搜索】</p><p>jm+号码</p><p><br/></p><p>【包含搜寻】</p><p>搜寻全彩[空格][+]人妻,仅显示全彩且是人妻的本本</p><p>范例:全彩 +人妻<br/></p><p>【排除搜寻】</p><p>搜寻全彩[空格][]人妻,显示全彩并排除人妻的本本</p><p>范例:全彩 -人妻<br/></p><p>【我都要搜寻】</p><p>搜寻全彩[空格]人妻,会显示所有包含全彩及人妻的本本</p><p>范例:全彩 人妻</p></body></html>": "<html><head/><body><p>Best way to search?</p><p>[Exact Search]</p><p>jm+ID</p><p><br/></p><p>[Include Search]</p><p>Search for full color [space] [+] married woman; only show comics that match both terms.</p><p>Example: full color +married woman<br/></p><p>[Exclude Search]</p><p>Search for full color [space] [-] married woman; show full color comics while excluding married woman.</p><p>Example: full color -married woman<br/></p><p>[Match All Terms]</p><p>Search for full color [space] married woman; show comics containing both terms.</p><p>Example: full color married woman</p></body></html>",
